ssia">West Prussia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1806</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/napoleon">Napoleon</a> defeats Prussia at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-jena-auerstedt">Jena and Auerstedt</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1815</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/congress-of-vienna">Congress of Vienna</a> grants Prussia the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhineland">Rhineland</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/westphalia">Westphalia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1866</span><span class="rf-text">Prussia defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-koniggratz">Königgrätz</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1871</span><span class="rf-text">William I is proclaimed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/german-emperor">German Emperor</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/versailles">Versailles</a></span></li></ol>
